{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1408258-any-advice-for-a-new-eclipse","id":1408258,"title":"Any Advice for a New Eclipse?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-08-14T15:28:13-07:00","id":1408258,"title":"Any Advice for a New Eclipse?","content":"First character I'm designing for EX3 and it's an Eclipse with a heavy lean towards Socialize, Larceny and Presence. But, it seems Bureaucracy and Investigation go really well with Socialize. Should I dabble into those charm trees and if so, which ones have you found to be the most helpful.<br /> <br /> A little backstory for help: the character is a master at infiltrating an organization and destroying/rebuilding it from the inside out. He uses disguises, demons, seduction, and kung fu (martial arts) to obtain his goals. Think James Bond spy more than an actual spy.<br /> <br /> I'm going to pick up Sorcery, Dreaming Pearl Courtesan Style, Silken Armor for a dapper suit, Appearance 5, etc. I feel the character is already pretty thinned out but I'm concerned that Socialize will not be enough to handle the organization tackling. Profiling people seems important (Investigation) and moving through an organization effortlessly (bureaucracy) also does.<br /> <br /> I guess my question is: Should I focus on a few things and be really good at them like in 2.5 or is it okay to be spread out in this edition? Also, if you have any cool Eclipse &quot;hacks&quot; and backstories, etc that would be really cool. I remember reading about comboing Presence charms with Linguistics to make mind control billboards, etc but it doesn't look like that's possible in this edition.<br /> <br /> Thanks!<br /> <br /> *edit* Also, is Integrity and Resolve a must for social characters or can I get away with Socialize and Guile?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3230,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3230-tyzerg","user":"Tyzerg","date":". 08-14-2020, 06:37 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3230-tyzerg","name":"Tyzerg","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3230_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"131"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-14T16:07:24-07:00","id":1408273,"title":"","content":"I don\u2019t really see how you\u2019re being spread too thinly here. You get 28 ability dots and you\u2019ve mentioned 7 abilities you want so far. That\u2019s enough to get them all to 3 and still have 7 leftover.<br /> <br /> Edit, you absolutely want integrity as well. If not you\u2019ll find your intimacies easily manipulated, and your character easily convinced.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1121,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","user":"DrLoveMonkey","date":". 08-14-2020, 07:11 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-14T16:55:21-07:00","id":1408281,"title":"","content":"Get these charms and the prerequisite abilities<br /> <br /> Bureaucracy<br /> Deft Official Way<br /> Measuring Glance<br /> <br /> Integrity<br /> Enduring Mental Toughness<br /> <br /> Investigation<br /> Watchman\u2019s Infallable Eye<br /> <br /> Larceny<br /> Spurious Presence<br /> Lock Opening Touch<br /> Flawlessly Impenetrable Disguise<br /> <br /> Occult<br /> Sorcery with summon demon<br /> <br /> Performance<br /> Masterful Performance Exercise<br /> Thousand courtesan ways<br /> Celestial Bliss Trick<br /> <br /> Presence <br /> Harmonious presence Meditation<br /> <br /> Dreaming Pearl<br /> Demure Carp Feint<br /> Elegant Weapon Repitoir<br /> Pearlescent Filigree Defense<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> That should be pretty solid all around.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-14T18:32:50-07:00","id":1408299,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>DrLoveMonkey</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1408258-any-advice-for-a-new-eclipse?p=1408281#post1408281\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">*snip*</div> </div> </div> </div>That's a solid list. You wouldn't recommend any Socialize charms or Dodge or Awareness?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3230-tyzerg","name":"Tyzerg","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3230_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"131"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-14T19:26:55-07:00","id":1408303,"title":"","content":"Everyone would, but that's 15 Charms, and the Dreaming Pearl MA charms make you need Dodge a lot less, Socialize mostly is interesting at the low level to get you double 9s on read intentions, which you don't necessarily and badly need early on, and boosting guile, which you can excellency. And instead of read intentions with socialize you can find your way around with Bureaucracy and Investigation. This is a solid starting Eclipse combo. Especially the 3 Larceny Charms make sure you'll always be where you need to be.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/903-cheshire-cat","name":"Cheshire Cat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar903_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"502"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-14T19:51:03-07:00","id":1408305,"title":"","content":"Be proactive on seeking out Eclipse Chamshare abilities. They let you do things no other Exalted can do. My personal favorite is Storm Mother's lightning, Tidemare's swim charm, and the Phoenix fire nove suicide attack (i let my Eclipse player use it on Incapacitated without dying)<br /> <br /> When you can spare the xp, Keen Hearing and Keen Sight are amazing for Socialites. Eavesdrop on people across the room. <br /> <br /> MAs are great for Socialites (especially DPC) because of the reward for low investment. <br /> <br /> Remember that you get a socialization bonus for being prettier than other people. <br /> <br /> Take time to think of good specialties. Mine were Socialize: making deals, Bureaucracy: logistics, and Presence: effeminate beauty (I was basically Hikaru Genji). <br /> <br /> Invest in people. Its easier to get access via side route than head on (&quot;the Pope's driver is the second most knowledgeable man in the Vatican&quot;). <br /> <br /> Let people &quot;catch&quot; you lying. The Kansas City Shuffle is the most powerful social trick of all time. <br /> <br /> Good luck","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Please be warned: this is not champagne, this is most likely a duck.<br /> -<i>Chausse</i><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#800080\"><i>Message me for Japanese translations.</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8830-sorcerous-overlord","name":"Sorcerous Overlord","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8830_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-14T20:30:50-07:00","id":1408306,"title":"","content":"Actually, as much as I enjoy and get mileage out of the \u201cread Intentions\u201d Charms in Socialize, I must say that the much more powerful Charms are Mastery of Small Manners and indecent proposal method, as people taking offense at your proposed influence is a serious limitation to social interaction.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-14T20:42:38-07:00","id":1408307,"title":"","content":"These are all great suggestions! I'm going to take most of the charm ideas and really focus on adding some Spirit Charms to my panoply. <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1408258-any-advice-for-a-new-eclipse?p=1408306#post1408306\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Actually, as much as I enjoy and get mileage out of the \u201cread Intentions\u201d Charms in Socialize, I must say that the much more powerful Charms are Mastery of Small Manners and indecent proposal method, as people taking offense at your proposed influence is a serious limitation to social interaction.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, I'm thinking Mastery of Small Manners and Spurious Presence mixed with ongoing Seasoned Criminal Method means he can blend into every part of society unquestioningly. <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3230-tyzerg","name":"Tyzerg","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3230_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"131"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-14T20:48:50-07:00","id":1408308,"title":"","content":"I'm gonna go against Sorcerous Overlord and say that in general you should avoid Eclipse charms. They tend to be less effective than any other possible option. The only one I would say is decent is the Neomah one, and that's still pretty situational. <br /> <br /> Be careful with your Eclipse oaths. They can bite you in the ass pretty hard if you're not careful. The RI charms are really good in Socialize, particularly the one that lets you read a whole room.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24587-yamajin","name":"Yamajin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24587_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"25"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-14T23:02:07-07:00","id":1408316,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>DrLoveMonkey</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1408258-any-advice-for-a-new-eclipse?p=1408281#post1408281\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Get these charms and the prerequisite abilities</div> </div> </div> </div>Fifteen E1 charms is a weird flex but I guess it can\u2019t be helped when the OP hasn\u2019t specified a supernal ability. *cough*","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13313-sith_happens","name":"Sith_Happens","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13313_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1177"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-14T23:24:43-07:00","id":1408318,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tyzerg</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1408258-any-advice-for-a-new-eclipse?p=1408299#post1408299\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That's a solid list. You wouldn't recommend any Socialize charms or Dodge or Awareness?</div> </div> </div> </div>Dodge, no, and awareness not super necessary beyond the excellency. Socialize you could swap something or other for Small Manners and something else. It's kind of up to personal preference.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sith_Happens</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1408258-any-advice-for-a-new-eclipse?p=1408316#post1408316\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Fifteen E1 charms is a weird flex but I guess it can\u2019t be helped when the OP hasn\u2019t specified a supernal ability. *cough*</div> </div> </div> </div>True no supernal was specified, but even if it was I might have suggested a spread something like that.<br /> <br /> I've found in the past that going really hard into your supernal right off chargen can have some drawbacks. For one it can make your character way too focused. Like if I suggested 9 larceny charms instead of 3 you could ditch the Investigation, Integrity, Presence and Performance charms to do that. If you did though you'd miss out on the ability to enter a room and instantly know that something is off, shrug off your stab wound and the six martinis that you have in you that's giving you a -3 to your integrity, drop your ability to have super efficient social exchanges, and completely give up all of your seduction charms. It might make sense for some characters, but not this more broad idea.<br /> <br /> The other reason is that it kind of sucks to have zero progression in what your character is good at. My first Ex3 character was a sorcerer, who took 15 occult charms right off the bat. It was kind of cool, but after five sessions I realized I had nothing to look forward to with regards to the thing my character was centered around. Now I much prefer to just take 15 Essence 1, or maybe 2 sometimes, charms, and use Supernal to skyrocket that ability in play","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-15T04:42:29-07:00","id":1408333,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>DrLoveMonkey</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1408258-any-advice-for-a-new-eclipse?p=1408318#post1408318\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">True no supernal was specified, but even if it was I might have suggested a spread something like that.<br /> <br /> I've found in the past that going really hard into your supernal right off chargen can have some drawbacks. For one it can make your character way too focused. Like if I suggested 9 larceny charms instead of 3 you could ditch the Investigation, Integrity, Presence and Performance charms to do that. If you did though you'd miss out on the ability to enter a room and instantly know that something is off, shrug off your stab wound and the six martinis that you have in you that's giving you a -3 to your integrity, drop your ability to have super efficient social exchanges, and completely give up all of your seduction charms. It might make sense for some characters, but not this more broad idea.</div> </div> </div> </div>Sorry, yeah Socialize was my Supernal. I like this spread anyways. You are correct, having a more balanced character after using your suggestions makes me feel a lot more confident in his initial abilities than going deep into Socialize right away. I also have a lot to look forward to as he progresses. I just swapped out Lock Opening Touch for Mastery of Small Manners but other than that, your suggestions were spot on. I didn't even have LOT on my radar before but now I'm definitely picking it up. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> I went with Corrupted Words as my control spell instead of DotFC for now, mostly because I couldn't cut any of the great charms you suggested and I like the control part of CW.<br /> <br /> Question: Pearlescent Filigree Defense doesn't stack with Silken Armor besides the mote pump and Hardness bump, correct?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3230-tyzerg","name":"Tyzerg","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3230_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"131"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-15T07:01:49-07:00","id":1408346,"title":"","content":"Let us know how play goes, okay? I wanna hear from another Socialize Supernal. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-15T07:14:08-07:00","id":1408348,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1408258-any-advice-for-a-new-eclipse?p=1408346#post1408346\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Let us know how play goes, okay? I wanna hear from another Socialize Supernal. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Will do! I had a vision of him being a dude who uses a ton of different disguises and characters to infiltrate different organizations before I even knew about the Persona tree in Socialize so this should be a lot of fun.<br /> <br /> Thanks!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3230-tyzerg","name":"Tyzerg","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3230_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"131"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-15T07:22:42-07:00","id":1408351,"title":"","content":"If you\u2019re Socialize Supernal then IMO you <i>need</i> to start with Wise-Eyed Courtier Method. Personally I\u2019d drop CBT and the two Bureau Charms for it.<br /> <br /> Preying on Uncertainty Approach should definitely be one of your first XP buys.<br /> <br /> ...On a related note Spurious Presence has a prereq (Seasoned Criminal Method). To make room for that, if you ask me you\u2019ll be fine for long enough without Enduring Mental Toughness.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":13313,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13313-sith_happens","user":"Sith_Happens","date":". 08-15-2020, 10:29 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13313-sith_happens","name":"Sith_Happens","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13313_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1177"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-15T07:38:22-07:00","id":1408353,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sith_Happens</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1408258-any-advice-for-a-new-eclipse?p=1408351#post1408351\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If you\u2019re Socialize Supernal then IMO you <i>need</i> to start with Wise-Eyed Courtier Method.</div> </div> </div> </div>As a person playing a Socialize Supernal, I got by okay waiting until I had some XP to purchase it.<br /> <br /> \u200bAnd like DrLoveMonkey said earlier, sometimes it's nicer to grow into it.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-15T07:38:46-07:00","id":1408354,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Yamajin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1408258-any-advice-for-a-new-eclipse?p=1408308#post1408308\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Be careful with your Eclipse oaths. They can bite you in the ass pretty hard if you're not careful. The RI charms are really good in Socialize, particularly the one that lets you read a whole room.</div> </div> </div> </div>If you\u2019re binding yourself with oaths, rather than just others, then the bite is part of the fun!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Hey, check out my first original RPG, <i>Post-Mortem, </i>here: <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/307131/PostMortem\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/307131/PostMortem</a><br /> <br /> Or read my Exalted novella <i>The Silence of Our Ancestors</i> here: <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/304805/The-Silence-of-Our-Ancestors-A-DragonBlooded-Novella\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product...looded-Novella</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1961-dex-davican","name":"Dex Davican","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1961_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"362"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-15T07:57:33-07:00","id":1408357,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sith_Happens</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1408258-any-advice-for-a-new-eclipse?p=1408351#post1408351\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If you\u2019re Socialize Supernal then IMO you <i>need</i> to start with Wise-Eyed Courtier Method. Personally I\u2019d drop CBT and the two Bureau Charms for it.<br /> <br /> Preying on Uncertainty Approach should definitely be one of your first XP buys.<br /> <br /> ...On a related note Spurious Presence has a prereq (Seasoned Criminal Method). To make room for that, if you ask me you\u2019ll be fine for long enough without Enduring Mental Toughness.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I dropped CBT for Seasoned Criminal Method and yes, I <i>need</i> WECM eventually but I like the Bureaucracy charms. I'm joining a game that the characters are already somewhat advanced (not sure on exp total) and the ST said he'd give me a &quot;boost&quot; so that'll be some of the first charms I buy are the prereqs for WECM if possible. <br /> <br /> PoUA is dope! I'll have to pick that up too!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3230-tyzerg","name":"Tyzerg","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3230_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"131"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-15T07:59:41-07:00","id":1408358,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1408258-any-advice-for-a-new-eclipse?p=1408353#post1408353\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">As a person playing a Socialize Supernal, I got by okay waiting until I had some XP to purchase it.<br /> <br /> \u200bAnd like DrLoveMonkey said earlier, sometimes it's nicer to grow into it.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Yeah, man. I haven't even rolled a Read Intentions roll yet, let alone <b>Super Read Intentions</b> so I'm excited just to play a manipulative socialite. I'll get there eventually.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3230-tyzerg","name":"Tyzerg","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3230_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"131"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-15T10:33:55-07:00","id":1408376,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1408258-any-advice-for-a-new-eclipse?p=1408353#post1408353\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And like DrLoveMonkey said earlier, sometimes it's nicer to grow into it.</div> </div> </div> </div>Socialize is one of the last abilities you need to worry about leaving more of to grow into. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13313-sith_happens","name":"Sith_Happens","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13313_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1177"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-15T13:22:52-07:00","id":1408404,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sith_Happens</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1408258-any-advice-for-a-new-eclipse?p=1408376#post1408376\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Socialize is one of the last abilities you need to worry about leaving more of to grow into. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>This is true, but unless your plan is to have 30+ socialize charms and nothing else, your options are to either start with a well-rounded character with many talents and grow into being a godlike socialite, or start as a godlike socialite and grow into being a well-rounded character with many talents.<br /> <br /> Especially true for somebody who's new to Ex3, starting low and broad will both give a good idea about where to go next, and also give an appreciation for just how unstoppable you are as a Solar with just an excellency, and just how much better you are with another ten charms past that.<br /> <br /> <br /> That being said, you should probably start with at least a couple of charms in your supernal ability, but take that with a grain of salt, I once started a Dawn Martial Arts supernal who didn't even start with the merit.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-15T21:18:58-07:00","id":1408457,"title":"","content":"<s>I mean every martial arts Charm or evocation you start with <i>is</i> one fewer native Charm you\u2019ll ever have, so...</s> <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13313-sith_happens","name":"Sith_Happens","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13313_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1177"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-23T07:29:02-07:00","id":1409899,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1408258-any-advice-for-a-new-eclipse?p=1408346#post1408346\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Let us know how play goes, okay? I wanna hear from another Socialize Supernal. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> So far, game did not go too well, unfortunately. I think the ST has a very loose grasp of the Social Influence rules as I tried to use a Read Intentions check to see if the city guard was just collecting a paycheck or if he was invested in the city's law and security. The ST told me &quot;he just stares at you patiently waiting for you to answer his questions&quot; without having me roll the actual roll. <br /> <br /> Later, I tried to use a performance-based Inspire action to get everyone's attention in a room and he claimed everyone was &quot;too distracted&quot; to notice me. When I pressed the issue saying I should at least get a roll against their Resolve he said &quot;they all have minimum Resolve 5+, and that's not even factoring Intimacies yet.&quot; So, I think he's just out to ruin my good time.<br /> <br /> I'll have to save the character for another adventure it would seem.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3230-tyzerg","name":"Tyzerg","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3230_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"131"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-23T07:54:33-07:00","id":1409906,"title":"","content":"That's super disappointing. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-23T08:32:05-07:00","id":1409914,"title":"","content":"\u201cI try to get everyone\u2019s attention.\u201d<br /> \u201cYou can\u2019t because they aren\u2019t paying attention to you.\u201d<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://media.boingboing.net/wp-content/uploads/2016/11/bcf.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13313-sith_happens","name":"Sith_Happens","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13313_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1177"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-23T16:51:39-07:00","id":1409976,"title":"","content":"In retrospect, that's kinda like saying, &quot;I wanna punch the guy,&quot; and being denied an attack roll with the justification, &quot;You can't, your fist isn't already in his face.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-23T17:21:35-07:00","id":1409981,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1408258-any-advice-for-a-new-eclipse?p=1409976#post1409976\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In retrospect, that's kinda like saying, &quot;I wanna punch the guy,&quot; and being denied an attack roll with the justification, &quot;You can't, your fist isn't already in his face.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, I know. I felt like being a troll in the next game and just saying &quot;I'm too distracted to take damage&quot; any time I was attacked during the game session but I feel that wouldn't accomplish much.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3230-tyzerg","name":"Tyzerg","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3230_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"131"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-23T22:07:39-07:00","id":1410014,"title":"","content":"<i>Exalted</i> isn't a great system for railroading STs. Either they take away capabilities that the PCs should rightfully have, or they get increasingly desperate to maintain some semblance of control while the PCs do things they didn't plan for. Or both.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Hey, check out my first original RPG, <i>Post-Mortem, </i>here: <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/307131/PostMortem\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/307131/PostMortem</a><br /> <br /> Or read my Exalted novella <i>The Silence of Our Ancestors</i> here: <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/304805/The-Silence-of-Our-Ancestors-A-DragonBlooded-Novella\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product...looded-Novella</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1961-dex-davican","name":"Dex Davican","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1961_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"362"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-24T10:33:34-07:00","id":1410098,"title":"","content":"I hope this ST isn't the one you're building your Night in the other thread for - something tells me that if he's going to act this way, changing your character isn't going to be the end of your problems with him.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-24T12:01:53-07:00","id":1410105,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1408258-any-advice-for-a-new-eclipse?p=1410098#post1410098\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I hope this ST isn't the one you're building your Night in the other thread for - something tells me that if he's going to act this way, changing your character isn't going to be the end of your problems with him.</div> </div> </div> </div>Naw, different ST, my cousin. He actually invited me to play in their game because I think he and his buddy were frustrated with the current ST and were looking to get me involved in Ex3 to help with the issues they were having. We are currently building new game with my cousin as ST and we probably aren't going to include the current ST in this game.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3230-tyzerg","name":"Tyzerg","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3230_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"131"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-25T11:00:45-07:00","id":1410336,"title":"","content":"Good on you. There was this one person on the Exalted Discord a few weeks ago who kept coming back with different \u201cHow good does this build look for the game I\u2019m in where hard-counters to me are the only opponents who ever exist\u201d and it was really sad to watch.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13313-sith_happens","name":"Sith_Happens","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13313_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1177"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}